# bashy verified build declaration for the OpenClaw gateway (builds/README.md).
# Shell-sourceable KEY=VALUE only. builds/render.sh renders ../fork from this
# file + files/ + build.yml + builds/_shared, and ships it verbatim as the
# fork's bashy-build/PIN. Bump only after reviewing the upstream release diff
# (see builds/openclaw/README.md). ONLY official stable release tags are
# accepted (no main/dev branches, no pre-releases, no RCs).
TOOL=openclaw
FORK_REPO=qiangli/openclaw
UPSTREAM_REPO=https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw
UPSTREAM_SLUG=openclaw/openclaw
UPSTREAM_TAG=v2026.10.2
UPSTREAM_COMMIT=b8952d477f0c932d8ddc6da5c89cab5a169b6ff1
# Toolchain kind: pnpm/Node build steps are tool-specific (build.yml next to
# this file: frozen pnpm install for the audit gates, audit gates, pinned
# upstream Dockerfile build (unshipped base) + /app extract, SBOM of the
# extracted tree, gate-first bundled-copy patch, re-stage of the exact
# shipped runtime, layered shipped-image build (Dockerfile.shipped, patched
# /app, never distributed), flatten + full-rootfs patch + single-layer
# import, image + tarball + archive-layer vulnerable-version gates,
# gzip-compressed docker-save image tar + digest).
# No separate audit job.
KIND=custom
# Node 24 (upstream Dockerfile node:24-bookworm), pnpm 12.5.1 (upstream
# packageManager); used by build.yml.
NODE_VERSION=24
PNPM_VERSION=12.5.1
COSIGN_VERSION=v3.1.3
# Linux-only matrix (free GitHub runners only): each leg builds the pinned
# upstream Dockerfile natively on its own arch, patches the extracted /app
# tree, and ships its own arch's patched runtime as BOTH an extracted-tree
# tarball and a gzip-compressed single-layer docker-save image tar (Docker
# archive format, not OCI layout). Asset names are
# openclaw-gateway-<os>-<arch>-${GITHUB_REF_NAME}.tgz / .docker.tar.gz. macOS
# assets are DEFERRED explicitly until a valid build path exists: macOS
# runners have no Docker daemon for the faithful Dockerfile path, and the
# previous native pack path died on all four legs of fork build 16
# (run 38343035125).
MATRIX="openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64=ubuntu-24.04 openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64=ubuntu-24.04-arm"
# Linux host packages: strace + iproute2 for the no-egress gate, curl for the
# pinned http-cache-semantics replacement tarball. Docker is preinstalled on
# the ubuntu runners and builds the pinned upstream Dockerfile.
APT_PACKAGES="strace iproute2 curl"
PRE_BUILD_GATES=""
# The re-staged PATCHED runtime tree (re-extracted from the patched tarball
# so it is byte-identical to what ships, staged under installed/package so
# the tar keeps its package/ top dir); the no-egress gate starts the gateway
# from it, i.e. from the exact patched runtime that ships in both the
# tarball and the flattened image (same /app bytes).
EGRESS_TARGET=installed/package
RELEASE_EXTRA="PIN=openclaw-pin.txt audit-exceptions=audit-exceptions"
RELEASE_ASSETS="openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.tgz openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.tgz openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.docker.tar.gz openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.docker.tar.gz openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-image-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-image-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-image-grype.json openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-image-grype.json openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-audit-full.json openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-audit-full.json openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-image.digest openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-image.digest openclaw-pin.txt audit-exceptions"
RELEASE_EXECUTABLES=""
RELEASE_NOTE="No tracking; OTel points only at the local collector 127.0.0.1:31415. Each Linux arch ships TWO forms of the same patched runtime (pinned upstream Dockerfile's built /app, node_modules included, no http-cache-semantics < 4.3.0 in any distributed byte): an extracted-tree tarball (unpack and run node openclaw.mjs gateway from package/, no registry access) and a gzip-compressed single-layer docker-save image tar — Docker archive format, not OCI layout (docker load -i <file>, image ID + compressed-tar sha256 + size + layer count in <asset>-image.digest). macOS assets deferred until a valid build path exists."
RELEASE_GATES="pinned commit, frozen pnpm install for the audit gates, pnpm audit vs reviewed exceptions, pinned upstream Dockerfile build (unshipped base) + /app extract, CycloneDX SBOM of the extracted tree, gate-first bundled http-cache-semantics patch, re-stage of the exact shipped runtime, layered shipped-image build with patched /app (never distributed), flatten + full-rootfs patch + single-layer import with config parity, tarball + merged-/app + archive-layer vulnerable-version gates with image/runtime diff, final flattened-/app vs signed-runtime identity, final whole-image CycloneDX SBOM and Grype high/critical vulnerability gate, gzip-compressed docker-save with digest re-verify + single-layer + 2GiB + docker-load round-trip, no-egress on the exact patched runtime."
